---
import { SITE, THEMES } from '../lib/site.config';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[var(--color-wine)] px-6 pt-[58px] pb-8 md:px-24">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1248px] flex-col gap-11">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <div class="flex max-w-[480px] flex-col gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]"></span>
          <span class="font-serif text-[21px] font-semibold text-[var(--color-on-wine)]">{SITE.title}</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-[12px] leading-[1.9] text-[var(--color-on-wine-muted)]">自分時間と暮らしのポートフォリオを、少しずつ。</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-[14px] leading-[1.9] text-[var(--color-on-wine-accent)]">老後に向けた「最後の攻め」と、資産の「守り方」を探る。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--color-on-wine-accent)]">READ</p>
          <a href="/blog" class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-on-wine)] hover:underline">実験ログ</a>
          {THEMES.map((theme) => (
            <a href={`/blog/category/${encodeURIComponent(theme.name)}`} class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-on-wine)] hover:underline">{theme.name}</a>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--color-on-wine-accent)]">ABOUT</p>
          <a href="/about" class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-on-wine)] hover:underline">このサイトについて</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-on-wine)] hover:underline">お問い合わせ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="h-px w-full bg-[var(--color-on-wine)] opacity-[0.18]"></div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-[10px] text-[var(--color-on-wine-muted)] sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} {SITE.title}</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:underline">個人情報保護方針</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:underline">利用規約</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
